WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.982
This is the final completion step for Module 5.

00:00:02.982 --> 00:00:10.357
The module tracks ten knowledge checks and six coding exercises, for sixteen required activities in total.

00:00:10.357 --> 00:00:17.417
Before selecting Complete Module, review the counters and make sure they reflect the work you intended to

00:00:17.417 --> 00:00:17.812
complete.

00:00:17.812 --> 00:00:24.412
If something is missing, the page should identify the unfinished activity so you can return to that slide.

00:00:24.412 --> 00:00:29.307
When you complete the module, the page creates a Canvas submission summary.

00:00:29.307 --> 00:00:35.342
That summary includes your knowledge-check status and the SQL saved for each coding exercise.

00:00:35.342 --> 00:00:38.012
Review the report before copying it.

00:00:38.012 --> 00:00:43.992
If the module is incomplete, the page will warn you so you know you are submitting partial progress.

00:00:43.992 --> 00:00:48.362
Also remember that the progress is stored locally in your current browser.

00:00:48.362 --> 00:00:54.162
If you move to another computer, use a private browsing window, or clear browser storage,

00:00:54.162 --> 00:00:57.017
the saved progress may not follow you.

00:00:57.017 --> 00:01:00.872
The purpose of this final page is not simply administrative.

00:01:00.872 --> 00:01:03.032
It is another validation step.

00:01:03.032 --> 00:01:09.494
Check that your answers, SQL, and completion status match what you actually did before you submit.
